    "title": "Link ordered and alternating events",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk3-sequence-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Link ordered and alternating events",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "先 identifies the first action relative to a later one. 再 introduces what follows after that action or condition; this use describes order, not something that has already happened again. 或者…或者… presents alternatives. 一会儿…一会儿… alternates activities over short intervals.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我先吃饭，再和妈妈说话。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ xiān chī fàn ， zài hé māma shuōhuà 。",
                "meaning": "I will eat first and then talk with Mum.",
                "audio": "2462144f09a9dbeb623185f56583b673e1de2a4213df9eac344c85a92d70341b"
              },
              {
                "text": "或者今天去，或者明天去。",
                "pinyin": "huòzhě jīntiān qù ， huòzhě míngtiān qù 。",
                "meaning": "Go either today or tomorrow.",
                "audio": "e4214d61e2854a143038fc192915935a97678bbae38c5ad5ef597a0f315f06f6"
              },
              {
                "text": "他一会儿看书，一会儿听歌。",
                "pinyin": "tā yīhuìr kàn shū ， yīhuìr tīng gē 。",
                "meaning": "He alternates between reading and listening to songs.",
                "audio": "80373d9ab395e72eda2e717d62d411813df50a0a38732c13295764a95e2d0334"
              }
            ]
          },
